      ],
      "source": "https://www.exploretennyson.com/history/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the 1870s, Berkeley evolved from a rural area into a resort destination featuring a bandstand, picnic ground, and zoo.",
